        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn TM Series Mortise Skeleton Key Lock Box Replacment</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis mortise skeleton lock can be used with or without a turnpiece in conjunction with a lever or a knob. Specifically designed to be used with or replace an Acorn Skeleton Mortise Lockset, the TM Series Mortise Lock Box has a black iron finish. A double cylinder lock, the deadbolt is operated by skeleton key from both the interior and the exterior. The front measures 5-1/2\" by 1\". Made for doors with a 2-1/2\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUnlike a simple tubular latch, this is a <b>mortise lock</b>. They are extremely durable and have a tighter clearance tolerance. You know it's a mortise lock when you hear that heavy, smooth, solid 'click' when the door closes shut.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features:</b> of the Mortise Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black</b></li>\r\n<li>Front Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Front Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Hub to center of lock 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When selecting the Handing:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/door-handing-picture.gif?v=1704352978\" border=\"0\" width=\"410\" height=\"150\" alt=\"door handing - left or right handed lever\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the knob or lever used.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder:</b> A knob operates the latch from both the interior and the exterior while a key operates the deadbolt from both sides of the door.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Black Iron Skeleton Key Mortise Lock, Acorn TM Series",
                "description": "Acorn TM Series Black Iron Skeleton Key Mortise Lock - This mortise skeleton lock can be used with or without a turnpiece in conjunction with a lever or a knob. Specifically designed to be used with or replace an Acorn Skeleton Mortise Lockset, the TM Series Mortise Lock Box has a black iron finish. A double cylinder lock, the deadbolt is operated by skeleton key from both the interior and the exterior. The front measures 5-1/2 inches by 1 inch. Made for doors with a 2-1/2 inch backset.",
